title: "The Metric Blind Spot in Deep Learning Brain MRI Reconstruction: review materials"
abstract: >-
  Protocol, search strategy, PRISMA records, per-study extracted data, screening
  decisions, and analysis code for a systematic review of how the safety, artifacts,
  and fidelity of deep-learning brain MRI reconstruction are evaluated.
